error-protocol-cell-count = 单元格数量与帧尺寸不匹配
error-protocol-clipboard-image-extension = 不支持的剪贴板图片扩展名
error-protocol-clipboard-image-size = 剪贴板图片大小必须在 1 字节到 16 MiB 之间
error-protocol-clipboard-image-target = 剪贴板图片目标必须为 1 到 1024 字节
error-protocol-cursor-bounds = 光标在帧之外
error-protocol-decode = 帧解码失败：{ $error }
error-protocol-delta-grid-limit = 画面增量网格超出限制
error-protocol-delta-metadata-cells = 画面增量元数据中含有单元格
error-protocol-delta-popup = 画面增量的弹出窗口更新与其弹出窗口不匹配
error-protocol-delta-span = 画面增量区段超出其网格、未排序或超出预算
error-protocol-empty-frame = 空帧
error-protocol-encode = 帧编码失败：{ $error }
error-protocol-encoding-json = 画面编码 JSON 无效：{ $error }
error-protocol-encoding-limit = 画面编码超出帧限制
error-protocol-encoding-payload = 画面编码负载无效：{ $error }
error-protocol-frame-limit = 帧超出限制
error-protocol-hyperlink-index = 超链接索引无效
error-protocol-io = 协议 I/O 失败：{ $error }
error-protocol-patch-cursor-bounds = 补丁光标在帧之外
error-protocol-patch-geometry = 画面补丁改变了窗格的几何尺寸
error-protocol-patch-identity = 画面补丁标识不匹配
error-protocol-patch-row-bounds = 画面补丁行在帧之外
error-protocol-scroll-bounds = 画面滚动区域在帧之外，或与其他区域重叠
error-protocol-scroll-count = 画面滚动的滚动计数无效
error-protocol-scroll-payload = 画面滚动未携带窗格补丁
error-protocol-scroll-truncated = 画面滚动被截断
error-protocol-surface-baseline = 画面更新与其基线不匹配
error-protocol-trailing-bytes = 帧末尾有多余字节
